{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03368","headline":"游云门寺 · 宋之问","name":"游云门寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"维舟探静域，作礼事尊经。\n投迹一萧散，爲心自杳冥。\n龛依大禹穴，楼倚少微星。\n沓嶂围兰若，回溪抱竹庭。\n觉花涂砌白，甘露洗山青。\n雁塔骞金地，虹桥转翠屏。\n人天宵现景，神鬼昼潜形。\n理胜常虚寂，缘空自感灵。\n入禅从鸽遶，说法有龙听。\n劫累终期灭，尘躬且未宁。\n摇摇不安寐，待月咏岩扃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}